# Third-party tree-sitter grammars that the native kernel compiles from source
# (codegraph-kernel/build.rs). Keep all of them out of GitHub's language
# statistics, and collapse only the generated parser.c files in pull-request
# diffs. The hand-written scanner.c files are where C gets patched or added,
# so they stay expanded for review.
# The /** is needed: an attributes pattern that names a directory does not
# reach the files inside it.
codegraph-kernel/grammars/** linguist-vendored
codegraph-kernel/grammars/**/parser.c linguist-generated
# The kernel's patched copy of the tree-sitter runtime crate (docs/grammars/web-tree-sitter-runtime.md).
codegraph-kernel/vendor/** linguist-vendored
